# Slice 282 probe: `@: x a\b` in a method, with a callable at the leaf, and with an initial value after the path.  Entry 7.
Inner:
    int: w 6
end: Inner
Second:
    int: w 8
end: Second
Outer:
    Model:
        int: v 4
    end: Model
    @: r Inner Inner
    fn: f () int
        return: 5
    end: f
end: Outer
fn: in_method () int
